# Overlay refresh

HUD overlays (XP tracker, FPS, ping, memory, timers) must not recompute displayed numbers every frame.

- Recalculate XP/hr and session totals at most every 250ms (`OverlayRefresh.XP_MS`).
- Recalculate FPS, memory, ping, and frame-time overlay text at most every 200ms (`OverlayRefresh.PERF_MS`).
- Timer infobox labels can update when the displayed second changes, not every present.
- Still *draw* cached text every frame so Alt-drag, anchors, and stacking stay smooth.
- Use `OverlayRefresh` constants instead of magic intervals.
- Java 7 source: no lambdas, no diamond operator.
